    'Uvježbaj: prva cjelovita preporuka' => 'Exercice : ta première recommandation complète',
    'In the <strong>Events</strong> section, check <strong>checkout.session.completed</strong>, <strong>invoice.paid</strong>, <strong>invoice.payment_failed</strong>, <strong>customer.subscription.updated</strong>, and <strong>customer.subscription.deleted</strong>, then save the webhook.' => 'Dans la section <strong>Events</strong>, coche <strong>checkout.session.completed</strong>, <strong>invoice.paid</strong>, <strong>invoice.payment_failed</strong>, <strong>customer.subscription.updated</strong> et <strong>customer.subscription.deleted</strong>, puis enregistre le webhook.',
    'Ovaj blok je vidljiv kao najava novog Funnel 2.0 modela, ali je trenutno nedostupan dok traje testiranje.' => 'Ce bloc est affiché en aperçu du nouveau modèle Funnel 2.0, mais il est actuellement indisponible pendant les tests.',
